    "C": "Draw a filled dot at \\(-1\\) and a ray extending to the right.",
    "D": "Draw an open circle at \\(-1\\) and a ray extending to the left."
  },
  "Correct Answer": "C",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "Use a filled dot when equality is included. Since \\(x\\) is greater than or equal to \\(-1\\), the ray extends to the right.",
